      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "IceCube established high-energy neutrino astronomy and opened a new observational window on the Universe. This is a major, lasting experimental achievement.",
        "attribution": "Halzen's scientific leadership and role in realizing IceCube make him a credible individual laureate, though the detector and discovery depended on a large international collaboration.",
        "maturity": "The discovery is supported by sustained observations and follow-up work; the field is firmly established.",
        "uncertainties": ["The balance between individual scientific leadership and the collaboration's collective contribution requires careful review."]
      }
    },
    {
